      "audit": "Native source sky, foreground shopfronts with embedded initial spectator poses, and cobbled floor. Bicycles, alternate spectator/barber frames and sky alternates omitted in this increment. Sheet title does not specify SFII edition. Border-connected gray sheet-layout background in the distant skyline is keyed and filled using repeated original sky pixels. Original lower sky pixels extend 16px behind foreground edges so corner framing never exposes clear color before the cobbled floor. The pale lavender lower sky (RGB 204,221,255) is genuine original full-sky artwork and remains visible between foreground buildings; it is not a missing asset or sheet key. Internal gray building facade pixels are preserved."
